.TH QUIPU-POLICY-BACKTEST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-policy\-backtest \- Backtest a candidate policy over recorded transactions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu policy backtest\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-last\-txs\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-to\-tx\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIcandidate.ttl\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Backtest a candidate policy over recorded transactions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-last\-txs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Number of recent transactions to evaluate
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
First transaction in the selected interval
.TP
\fB\-\-to\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Last transaction in the selected interval
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIcandidate.ttl\fR>

